---
layout: refonte
title: Photos
permalink: /refonte/photos/
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav aria-label="Fil d'Ariane">
      <ol class="breadcrumb">
        <li><a href="/refonte/">Accueil</a></li>
        <li aria-current="page">Photos</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <p class="kicker">Galeries</p>
    <h1>Mes <em>photos</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Quelques instantanés, entre voyages et quotidien. Chaque galerie raconte un lieu, un moment.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid-galeries">
      {% for galerie in galeries %}
      <a href="/refonte/photos/{{ galerie.slug }}/" class="card-galerie">
        <div class="card-galerie__image">
          <img src="{{ galerie.thumbnail }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="card-galerie__title">{{ galerie.title | e }}</div>
        <div class="card-galerie__meta">
          {{ galerie.images.length }} photos ·
          <time datetime="{{ galerie.date }}">{{ galerie.date | formatDateFr }}</time>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
